sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EPCtrl as ExternalProvider<br/>Controller
    participant EMCtrl as ExternalModel<br/>Controller
    participant Secret as Kubernetes Secret
    participant IstioSE as Istio ServiceEntry
    participant IstioDR as Istio DestinationRule
    participant ExtSvc as ExternalName Service
    participant HTTPRoute as Gateway API HTTPRoute
    participant Gateway as maas-default-gateway<br/>(openshift-ingress)
    participant PluginChain as Payload Processor<br/>Plugin Chain
    participant LLM as External LLM API<br/>(OpenAI/Anthropic/etc)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,ExtSvc: Provider Registration Flow
        User->>K8sAPI: Create ExternalProvider CR<br/>(auth: apikey/sigv4/oauth2,<br/>secretRef)
        K8sAPI->>EPCtrl: Watch event: ExternalProvider created
        EPCtrl->>K8sAPI: Get Secret (validate exists)
        K8sAPI-->>EPCtrl: Secret data
        EPCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ExternalName Service<br/>(port 443, target: provider endpoint)
        EPCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Istio ServiceEntry<br/>(MESH_EXTERNAL, DNS resolution)
        EPCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Istio DestinationRule<br/>(TLS SIMPLE origination)
        EPCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update ExternalProvider status<br/>(conditions)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,HTTPRoute: Model Routing Flow
        User->>K8sAPI: Create ExternalModel CR<br/>(provider refs, traffic weights)
        K8sAPI->>EMCtrl: Watch event: ExternalModel created
        EMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Resolve provider references
        K8sAPI-->>EMCtrl: ExternalProvider specs
        EMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>(path: /<ns>/<model>,<br/>backendRefs: provider services,<br/>timeout: 300s)
        EMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update ExternalModel status
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Gateway,LLM: Inference Request Flow (Runtime)
        Gateway->>PluginChain: Inference request<br/>(POST /<ns>/<model>:predict)
        PluginChain->>PluginChain: model-provider-resolver:<br/>resolve model → provider
        PluginChain->>PluginChain: API translation:<br/>transform to provider format
        PluginChain->>Secret: Read credentials
        Secret-->>PluginChain: API key / SigV4 / OAuth2 token
        PluginChain->>PluginChain: API key injection:<br/>attach credentials
        PluginChain->>LLM: Translated request<br/>with credentials<br/>(HTTPS/443, TLS)
        LLM-->>PluginChain: Provider response
        PluginChain->>PluginChain: API translation:<br/>normalize response
        PluginChain-->>Gateway: Normalized response
    end
